n class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n            </tr>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"module-name\">\n                <span class=\"module-icon\">👥</span>\n                User Management\n              </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;userManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('owner') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;userManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('admin') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;userManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('engineer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;userManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('installer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;userManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('helpdesk') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;userManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('viewer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n            </tr>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"module-name\">\n                <span class=\"module-icon\">⚙️</span>\n                Tenant Settings\n              </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;tenantSettings&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('owner') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;tenantSettings&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('admin') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;tenantSettings&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('engineer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;tenantSettings&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('installer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;tenantSettings&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('helpdesk') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;tenantSettings&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('viewer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n            </tr>\n\n            <tr>\n              <td class=\"module-name\">\n                <span class=\"module-icon\">🔧</span>\n                Backend Management\n              </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;backendManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('owner') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;backendManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('admin') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;backendManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('engineer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;backendManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('installer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;backendManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('helpdesk') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n                  <td class=\"checkbox-cell\">\n                    <label class=\"checkbox-container\">\n                      <input\n                        type=\"checkbox\" data-cwl-on-change=\"action:toggleModule\" data-cwl-on-change-args=\"role, &quot;backendManagement&quot;\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isRoleLocked('viewer') || saving\"\n                      />\n                      <span class=\"checkmark\"></span>\n                    </label>\n                  </td>\n\n            </tr>\n\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <h3>Legend:</h3>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ <strong>Checked</strong> = Role can access this module</li>\n        <li>❌ <strong>Unchecked</strong> = Role cannot access this module</li>\n        <li>🔒 <strong>Locked</strong> = Owner role always has full access (cannot be changed)</li>\n        <li>🔄 <strong>Reset</strong> = Reset individual role to default permissions</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n  <div\n    class=\"modal-backdrop\"\n    role=\"presentation\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n    tabindex=\"-1\" data-cwl-toggle=\"showResetConfirm:false\"\n   data-cwl-shell-key=\"showResetConfirm\" hidden>\n    <div\n      class=\"modal-content\"\n      role=\"dialog\"\n      aria-modal=\"true\"\n      aria-label=\"Reset module access confirmation dialog\"\n      tabindex=\"0\" data-cwl-on-keydown=\"toggle:showResetConfirm:false\"\n    >\n      <div class=\"modal-header\">\n        <h2>Reset All to Defaults?</h2>\n        <button class=\"close-btn\" data-cwl-toggle=\"showResetConfirm:false\" aria-label=\"Show Reset Confirm\">✕</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        <p>This will reset module access for all roles to their default configurations.</p>\n        <p class=\"warning-text\">Any custom changes will be lost. This cannot be undone.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"modal-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\" data-cwl-toggle=\"showResetConfirm:false\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"saving\" aria-label=\"Show Reset Confirm\">\n          Cancel\n        </button>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-danger\" data-cwl-action=\"handleResetAll\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"saving\" aria-label=\"Reset All\">\n\n            Yes, Reset All\n\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div>";
}

@page GET "/setup-admin"
page setup_admin_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/setup-admin" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"setup-admin\" data-wisp-path=\"/setup-admin\" data-cwl-island=\"client\"><div class=\"setup-container\">\n  <div class=\"setup-card\">\n    <h1>🔧 Setup Admin Access</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">Grant yourself owner access to your tenants</p>\n\n    <div class=\"info-box\">\n      <p><strong>This will:</strong></p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>✅ Grant you owner role in all your tenants</li>\n        <li>✅ Enable User Management module</li>\n        <li>✅ Enable Help Desk module</li>\n        <li>✅ Allow you to invite other users</li>\n        <li>✅ Give you full administrative access</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"alert alert-error\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <span>❌</span>\n        <pre></pre>\n      </div>\n\n    <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"result\"><div class=\"alert\">\n        <pre></pre>\n      </div></div>\n\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary btn-large\" data-cwl-action=\"setupAdmin\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"loading\" aria-label=\"Setup Admin\">\n\n        🚀 Setup Admin Access\n\n        <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">✅ Setup Complete\n      </div>\n    </button>\n\n      <div class=\"next-steps\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <h3>🎉 Success!</h3>\n        <p>You are now an owner of your tenants.</p>\n        <a href=\"/dashboard\" class=\"btn btn-secondary\">\n          ← Back to Dashboard\n        </a>\n        <p class=\"hint\">Refresh the page (Ctrl+Shift+R) to see User Management and Help Desk modules</p>\n      </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div></div>";
}

@page GET "/signup"
page signup_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/signup" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"signup\" data-wisp-path=\"/signup\" data-cwl-island=\"client\"><div class=\"signup-wizard\">\n  <div class=\"wizard-container\">\n    <div class=\"wizard-header\">\n      <h1>Create Your Account</h1>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Get started with WISP Management in just a few steps</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"progress-bar\">\n      <div class=\"progress\" style=\"width: %\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"wizard-content\">\n\n        <div class=\"error-message\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"error-icon\">⚠️</span>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"success-message\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span class=\"success-icon\">✅</span>\n\n        </div>\n\n      <!-- Step 1: Email Verification -->\n      <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"step === 1\"><div class=\"step-content\">\n          <h2>Step 1: Verify Your Email</h2>\n          <p class=\"step-description\">We'll send a verification code to your email address to ensure it's valid.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"email\">Email Address <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input\n              id=\"email\"\n              type=\"email\"\n              placeholder=\"your@email.com\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading || verificationCodeSent\"\n              required\n            />\n          </div>\n\n            <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem;\">\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-action=\"sendVerificationCode\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading || !email\"\n               aria-label=\"Send Verification Code\">\n\n                  Send Verification Code\n\n                  <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"spinner\"></span>\n                  Sending...\n                </div>\n              </button>\n\n              <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin: 0.5rem 0;\">\n                <div style=\"flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border-color, #d1d5db);\"></div>\n                <span style=\"color: var(--text-secondary, #6b7280); font-size: 0.875rem;\">OR</span>\n                <div style=\"flex: 1; height: 1px; background: var(--border-color, #d1d5db);\"></div>\n              </div>\n\n              <button\n                type=\"button\"\n                class=\"btn-google\" data-cwl-action=\"handleGoogleSignIn\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n                style=\"width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.75rem; padding: 0.9rem 1rem; border-radius: 0.6rem; background: #ffffff; color: #1a2332; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\"\n               aria-label=\"Google Sign In\">\n                <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 533.5 544.3\" style=\"width: 20px; height: 20px;\">\n                  <path fill=\"#4285f4\" d=\"M533.5 278.4c0-17.4-1.4-34.1-4.1-50.2H272v95h147.5c-6.4 34-25 62.8-53.4 82v68h86.1c50.4-46.5 80.3-115.1 80.3-194.8z\"/>\n                  <path fill=\"#34a853\" d=\"M272 544.3c72.2 0 132.8-23.9 177-64.7l-86.1-68c-23.9 16.1-54.5 25.7-90.9 25.7-69.9 0-129.2-47.2-150.4-110.5h-90.7v69.8c44 87.4 134.5 148.7 241.1 148.7z\"/>\n                  <path fill=\"#fbbc04\" d=\"M121.6 326.8c-10.2-30-10.2-62.5 0-92.5v-69.8h-90.7c-37.3 74.6-37.3 158.4 0 233z\"/>\n                  <path fill=\"#ea4335\" d=\"M272 107.7c39.2-.6 76.4 13.8 105 39.9l78.2-78.2C404.5 25.5 344 0 272 0 165.4 0 74.9 61.3 30.9 148.7l90.7 69.8C142.7 175 202.1 107.7 272 107.7z\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <span>Sign up with Google</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      <!-- Step 2: Tenant Information --></div><div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"step === 2\"><div class=\"step-content\">\n          <h2>Step 2: Payment Option</h2>\n          <p class=\"step-description\">Select your preferred payment method. No charges will be made at this time.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"beta-disclaimer\">\n            <div class=\"beta-badge\">BETA</div>\n            <p><strong>WISPTools.io is currently in beta.</strong> Start with our free beta option - no payment required. You can upgrade to a paid plan later from your account settings.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Payment Option <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <div class=\"payment-method-options\">\n              <label class=\"payment-option\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"radio\"\n                  name=\"paymentMethod\"\n                  value=\"beta\"\n                  checked data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n                />\n                <div class=\"payment-option-content\">\n                  <div class=\"payment-icon\">🎉</div>\n                  <div>\n                    <strong>Beta (Free)</strong>\n                    <p>Free access during beta period - No payment required</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </label>\n              <label class=\"payment-option\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"radio\"\n                  name=\"paymentMethod\"\n                  value=\"paypal\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n                />\n                <div class=\"payment-option-content\">\n                  <div class=\"payment-icon\">💳</div>\n                  <div>\n                    <strong>PayPal</strong>\n                    <p>Pay with PayPal account (set up now, charges begin after beta)</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </label>\n              <label class=\"payment-option\">\n                <input\n                  type=\"radio\"\n                  name=\"paymentMethod\"\n                  value=\"credit_card\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n                />\n                <div class=\"payment-option-content\">\n                  <div class=\"payment-icon\">💳</div>\n                  <div>\n                    <strong>Credit Card</strong>\n                    <p>Pay with credit or debit card (set up now, charges begin after beta)</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </label>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-actions\">\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n            >\n              ← Back\n            </button>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-action=\"handlePaymentSubmit\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading || !paymentMethodType\"\n             aria-label=\"Payment Submit\">\n              Continue →\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div></div><div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"step === 3\"><div class=\"step-content\">\n          <h2>Step 3: Organization Information</h2>\n          <p class=\"step-description\">Tell us about your organization.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"tenantName\">Organization Name <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input\n              id=\"tenantName\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              placeholder=\"Acme WISP\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n              required\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"displayName\">Display Name <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input\n              id=\"displayName\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              placeholder=\"Acme Wireless Internet\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n              required\n            />\n            <p class=\"help-text\">This is how your organization will appear in the system</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"contactPhone\">Contact Phone <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input\n              id=\"contactPhone\"\n              type=\"tel\"\n              placeholder=\"+1 (555) 123-4567\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n              required\n            />\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"subdomain\">Subdomain <span class=\"required\">*</span></label>\n            <input\n              id=\"subdomain\"\n              type=\"text\"\n              placeholder=\"acme-wisp\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n              minlength=\"3\"\n              maxlength=\"63\"\n              required\n            />\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Unique subdomain for your organization (lowercase letters, numbers, and hyphens only). Will be auto-generated from tenant name if left blank.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Primary Location (Optional)</label>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">You can create your primary location (NOC/HQ/Tower) after completing setup from the coverage map.</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-actions\">\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n            >\n              ← Back\n            </button>\n            <button\n              type=\"button\"\n              class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-action=\"handleTenantSubmit\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isLoading\"\n             aria-label=\"Tenant Submit\">\n\n                Finish\n\n                <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"spinner\"></span>\n                Creating...\n              </div>\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      <!-- Step 3: Payment Information -->\n      <!-- Step 4: Success --></div><div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"step === 4\"><div class=\"step-content success-step\">\n          <div class=\"success-icon-large\">✅</div>\n          <h2>Account Created Successfully!</h2>\n          <p class=\"success-message\">\n            Your WISP Management account has been created. You can now start using the platform.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"success-details\">\n            <p><strong>Organization:</strong> </p>\n            <p><strong>Email:</strong> </p>\n\n              <p><strong>Payment Option:</strong> Beta (Free) - No payment required ✓</p>\n\n          </div>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/login?signup=success\"\n          >\n            Go to Login →\n          </button>\n        </div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div></div>";
}

@page GET "/support-dashboard"
page support_dashboard_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/support-dashboard" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"support-dashboard\" data-wisp-path=\"/support-dashboard\" data-cwl-island=\"client\"><div class=\"support-dashboard\">\n    <header class=\"dashboard-header\">\n      <div class=\"header-content\">\n        <h1>🎧 Customer Support Dashboard</h1>\n        <p class=\"subtitle\"> - Support Portal</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"header-actions\">\n        <button class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers/portal-setup\">\n          ⚙️ Portal Settings\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n      <!-- Stats Cards -->\n      <div class=\"stats-grid\">\n        <div class=\"stat-card alerts\">\n          <div class=\"stat-icon\">🚨</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-content\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"stats.activeAlerts\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Active Alerts</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-card tickets\">\n          <div class=\"stat-icon\">🎫</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-content\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"stats.pendingTickets\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Pending Tickets</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-card chats\">\n          <div class=\"stat-icon\">💬</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-content\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"stats.openChats\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Open Chats</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stat-card customers\">\n          <div class=\"stat-icon\">👥</div>\n          <div class=\"stat-content\">\n            <div class=\"stat-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"stats.totalCustomers\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Customers</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Quick Actions -->\n      <div class=\"quick-actions\">\n        <h2>Quick Actions</h2>\n        <div class=\"actions-grid\">\n          <button class=\"action-card\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers/portal-setup?tab=alerts\">\n            <span class=\"action-icon\">🚨</span>\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Manage Alerts</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"action-card\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers/portal-setup?tab=faq\">\n            <span class=\"action-icon\">❓</span>\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Edit FAQ</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"action-card\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers/portal-setup?tab=knowledge\">\n            <span class=\"action-icon\">📚</span>\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Knowledge Base</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"action-card\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers/portal-setup?tab=chat\">\n            <span class=\"action-icon\">💬</span>\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Chat Settings</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"action-card\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/help-desk\">\n            <span class=\"action-icon\">🎫</span>\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Help Desk</span>\n          </button>\n\n          <button class=\"action-card\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers\">\n            <span class=\"action-icon\">👥</span>\n            <span class=\"action-label\">Customers</span>\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Active Alerts Section -->\n\n        <div class=\"section\">\n          <div class=\"section-header\">\n            <h2>🚨 Active Alerts</h2>\n            <button class=\"btn-link\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers/portal-setup?tab=alerts\">\n              Manage All →\n            </button>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"alerts-list\">\n            <div data-cwl-bind=\"each\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"activeAlerts as alert\" data-cwl-each-item=\"alert\" data-cwl-each-tpl=\"%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22alert-item%20%7Balert.type%7D%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cspan%20class%3D%22alert-icon%22%3E%7BgetAlertIcon(alert.type)%7D%3C%2Fspan%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22alert-content%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Ch4%3E%7Balert.title%7D%3C%2Fh4%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cp%3E%7Balert.message%7D%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cspan%20class%3D%22alert-status%22%3E%7Balert.status%7D%3C%2Fspan%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20\"><div class=\"alert-item \">\n                <span class=\"alert-icon\"></span>\n                <div class=\"alert-content\">\n                  <h4></h4>\n                  <p></p>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"alert-status\"></span>\n              </div></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      <!-- Recent Tickets Section -->\n      <div class=\"section\">\n        <div class=\"section-header\">\n          <h2>🎫 Recent Support Tickets</h2>\n          <button class=\"btn-link\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/help-desk\">\n            View All →\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n          <div class=\"tickets-list\">\n            <div data-cwl-bind=\"each\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"recentTickets as ticket\" data-cwl-each-item=\"ticket\" data-cwl-each-tpl=\"%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22ticket-item%22%20data-cwl-nav%3D%22%2Fmodules%2Fhelp-desk%3Fticket%3D%7Bticket._id%7D%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22ticket-main%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Ch4%3E%7Bticket.subject%7D%3C%2Fh4%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cp%20class%3D%22ticket-meta%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7Bticket.customerName%20%7C%7C%20'Customer'%7D%20%E2%80%A2%20%7BformatDate(ticket.createdAt)%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cdiv%20class%3D%22ticket-badges%22%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cspan%20class%3D%22priority-badge%20%7BgetTicketPriorityClass(ticket.priority)%7D%22%3E%7Bticket.priority%7D%3C%2Fspan%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Cspan%20class%3D%22status-badge%20%7BgetStatusClass(ticket.status)%7D%22%3E%7Bticket.status%7D%3C%2Fspan%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3C%2Fdiv%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20\"><div class=\"ticket-item\">\n                <div class=\"ticket-main\">\n                  <h4></h4>\n                  <p class=\"ticket-meta\">\n                     •\n                  </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"ticket-badges\">\n                  <span class=\"priority-badge \"></span>\n                  <span class=\"status-badge \"></span>\n                </div>\n              </div></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"empty-state\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <p>No recent tickets</p>\n          </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n  </div></div>";
}

@page GET "/tenant-admin"
page tenant_admin_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/tenant-admin" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"tenant-admin\" data-wisp-path=\"/tenant-admin\" data-cwl-island=\"client\"><div class=\"tenant-admin-page\">\n  <div class=\"admin-header\">\n    <div>\n      <button class=\"back-btn\" data-cwl-nav=\"/dashboard\">\n        ← Back to Dashboard\n      </button>\n      <h1>🏢 Tenant Settings</h1>\n      <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant\"><p class=\"tenant-name\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant.displayName\"></span></p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"error && !tenant\"><div class=\"error-container\">\n      <span class=\"error-icon\">⚠️</span>\n      <h2>Error</h2>\n      <p></p>\n    </div></div><div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant\"><div class=\"admin-container\">\n      <div class=\"tabs\">\n        <button\n          class=\"tab\" data-cwl-set=\"activeTab:general\"\n        >\n          General\n        </button>\n        <button\n          class=\"tab\" data-cwl-set=\"activeTab:devices\"\n        >\n          Device Settings\n        </button>\n        <button\n          class=\"tab\" data-cwl-set=\"activeTab:connection\"\n        >\n          Connection\n        </button>\n        <button\n          class=\"tab\" data-cwl-set=\"activeTab:limits\"\n        >\n          Limits & Quotas\n        </button>\n        <button\n          class=\"tab\" data-cwl-set=\"activeTab:users\"\n        >\n          Users\n        </button>\n      </div>\n\n    <div class=\"success-message\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <span class=\"success-icon\">✅</span>\n      <span></span>\n      <button class=\"dismiss-btn\" data-cwl-set=\"success:\">✕</button>\n    </div>\n\n  <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"error && tenant\"><div class=\"error-message\">\n      <span class=\"error-icon\">⚠️</span>\n      <span></span>\n      <button class=\"dismiss-btn\" data-cwl-set=\"error:\">✕</button>\n    </div></div>\n\n        <div class=\"settings-panel\">\n          <h2>General Settings</h2>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Organization Name</label>\n            <input type=\"text\" />\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Contact Email</label>\n            <input type=\"email\" />\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Contact Phone</label>\n            <input type=\"tel\" />\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label for=\"tenant-timezone\">Timezone</label>\n            <select id=\"tenant-timezone\">\n              <div data-cwl-bind=\"each\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"US_TIMEZONES as tz\" data-cwl-each-item=\"tz\" data-cwl-each-tpl=\"%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%3Coption%20value%3D%7Btz.value%7D%3E%7Btz.label%7D%3C%2Foption%3E%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20\"><option></option></div>\n            </select>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">All device times will be displayed in this timezone</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <div class=\"field-label\">Status</div>\n            <div class=\"status-badge status-\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant.status\"></span></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <div class=\"field-label\">Created</div>\n            <p class=\"read-only\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"formatInTenantTimezone(tenant.createdAt)\"></span></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <button class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-action=\"saveGeneralSettings\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isSaving\" aria-label=\"Save General Settings\">\n            Save General Settings\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n      <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"activeTab === 'devices'\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"settings-panel\">\n          <h2>Device Management Settings</h2>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Inform Interval (seconds)</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"60\"\n              max=\"3600\"\n            />\n            <p class=\"help-text\">How often devices report to the ACS (60-3600 seconds)</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" />\n              Enable Auto Discovery\n            </label>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Automatically discover new devices when they connect</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" />\n              Enable PCI Monitoring\n            </label>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Monitor LTE PCI values and detect conflicts</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>\n              <input type=\"checkbox\" />\n              Enable Performance Monitoring\n            </label>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Track device performance metrics</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"form-group\">\n            <label>Data Retention (days)</label>\n            <input\n              type=\"number\"\n              min=\"7\"\n              max=\"365\"\n            />\n            <p class=\"help-text\">How long to keep historical data (7-365 days)</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <button class=\"btn-primary\" type=\"button\" data-cwl-action=\"saveDeviceSettings\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isSaving\" aria-label=\"Save Device Settings\">\n            Save Device Settings\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"activeTab === 'connection'\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"settings-panel\">\n          <h2>Connection Information</h2>\n\n          <div class=\"info-box\">\n            <h3>CWMP Connection URL</h3>\n            <div class=\"url-display\">\n              <code><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant.cwmpUrl\"></span></code>\n              <button class=\"copy-btn\" data-cwl-action=\"copyToClipboard\" data-cwl-action-args=\"tenant.cwmpUrl\" aria-label=\"Copy To Clipboard\">\n                📋 Copy\n              </button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Configure this URL in your TR-069 devices as the ACS URL</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"info-box\">\n            <h3>Tenant Subdomain</h3>\n            <code class=\"subdomain-display\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant.subdomain\"></span></code>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Unique identifier for your organization</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"info-box credentials-box\">\n            <h3>ACS Authentication Credentials</h3>\n            <p class=\"help-text\">Credentials that CPE devices must use to connect</p>\n\n            <div class=\"form-group\">\n              <label>\n                <input type=\"checkbox\" />\n                Require Authentication\n              </label>\n              <p class=\"help-text\">If enabled, devices must provide username/password</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"credentials-grid\">\n              <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"acs-username\">ACS Username</label>\n                <input\n                  id=\"acs-username\"\n                  type=\"text\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"!settings.requireAuth\"\n                  placeholder=\"admin\"\n                />\n              </div>\n\n              <div class=\"form-group\">\n                <label for=\"acs-password\">ACS Password</label>\n                <div class=\"password-field\">\n                  <input\n                    id=\"acs-password\"\n                    type=\"text\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"!settings.requireAuth\"\n                    placeholder=\"••••••••\"\n                  />\n                  <button\n                    class=\"generate-btn\" data-cwl-action=\"generateAcsPassword\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"!settings.requireAuth\"\n                   aria-label=\"Generate Acs Password\">\n                    🔄 Generate\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <button\n              class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-action=\"saveDeviceSettings\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isSaving\"\n             aria-label=\"Save Device Settings\">\n              Save ACS Credentials\n            </button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"info-box\">\n            <h3>Connection Instructions</h3>\n            <ol class=\"instructions\">\n              <li>Access your device's TR-069 configuration</li>\n              <li>Set <strong>ACS URL</strong> to: <code><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"tenant.cwmpUrl\"></span></code></li>\n\n                <li>Authentication not required (optional)</li>\n\n                <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"><li>Set <strong>ACS Username</strong> to: <code><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"settings.acsUsername\"></span></code></li>\n                <li>Set <strong>ACS Password</strong> to: <code><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"settings.acsPassword\"></span></code></li>\n              </div>\n              <li>Save and reboot the device</li>\n              <li>Device should appear in your device list within 5 minutes</li>\n            </ol>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"activeTab === 'limits'\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"settings-panel\">\n          <h2>Limits & Quotas</h2>\n          <p class=\"subtitle\">Current plan limits for your organization</p>\n\n          <div class=\"limits-grid\">\n            <div class=\"limit-card\">\n              <h3>Max Devices</h3>\n              <div class=\"limit-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"limits.maxDevices\"></span></div>\n              <input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" />\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"limit-card\">\n              <h3>Max Users</h3>\n              <div class=\"limit-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"limits.maxUsers\"></span></div>\n              <input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" />\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"limit-card\">\n              <h3>Max Networks</h3>\n              <div class=\"limit-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"limits.maxNetworks\"></span></div>\n              <input type=\"number\" min=\"1\" />\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"limit-card\">\n              <h3>Storage Quota (MB)</h3>\n              <div class=\"limit-value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"limits.storageQuotaMB\"></span></div>\n              <input type=\"number\" min=\"100\" step=\"100\" />\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <button class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-action=\"saveLimits\" data-cwl-attr-disabled=\"isSaving\" aria-label=\"Save Limits\">\n            Update Limits\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"activeTab === 'users'\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div class=\"settings-panel\">\n          <h2>User Management</h2>\n          <p class=\"subtitle\">Manage users and their roles in your organization</p>\n\n          <div class=\"user-management-redirect\">\n            <p>Manage your team members and their access levels</p>\n            <button class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/tenant-management/users\">\n              👥 Manage Users\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div>\n    <div class=\"loading-container\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <div class=\"spinner-large\"></div>\n      <p>Loading tenant settings...</p>\n    </div>\n\n</div></div>";
}

@page GET "/tenant-selector"
page tenant_selector_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/tenant-selector" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"auth-redirect\" data-wisp-path=\"/tenant-selector\"><div class=\"loading-page\"><div class=\"spinner\"></div><p>Checking authentication...</p></div><script>(function(){function go(p){location.replace(p);}try{var a=window.firebase&&firebase.auth&&firebase.auth();if(a&&a.onAuthStateChanged){a.onAuthStateChanged(function(u){go(u?\"/dashboard\":\"/login\");});return;}var u=localStorage.getItem(\"firebase:authUser\")||sessionStorage.getItem(\"wisp-demo-user\")||localStorage.getItem(\"wisp-customer-session\")||sessionStorage.getItem(\"wisp-customer-session\");go(u?\"/dashboard\":\"/login\");}catch(e){go(\"/login\");}})();</script><noscript><a href=\"/login\">Continue to login</a></noscript></div>";
}

@page GET "/tenant-setup"
page tenant_setup_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/tenant-setup" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"auth-redirect\" data-wisp-path=\"/tenant-setup\"><div class=\"loading-page\"><div class=\"spinner\"></div><p>Checking authentication...</p></div><script>(function(){function go(p){location.replace(p);}try{var a=window.firebase&&firebase.auth&&firebase.auth();if(a&&a.onAuthStateChanged){a.onAuthStateChanged(function(u){go(u?\"/dashboard\":\"/login\");});return;}var u=localStorage.getItem(\"firebase:authUser\")||sessionStorage.getItem(\"wisp-demo-user\")||localStorage.getItem(\"wisp-customer-session\")||sessionStorage.getItem(\"wisp-customer-session\");go(u?\"/dashboard\":\"/login\");}catch(e){go(\"/login\");}})();</script><noscript><a href=\"/login\">Continue to login</a></noscript></div>";
}

@page GET "/wizards"
page wizards_page {
  effects: session.read;
  content-type "text/html; charset=utf-8";
  load { source: "origin-convert-all", httpPath: "/wizards" };
  return html "<div class=\"wisp-app-surface\" data-wisp-page=\"wizards\" data-wisp-path=\"/wizards\" data-cwl-island=\"client\"><div class=\"wizards-page\">\n    <header class=\"wizards-header\">\n      <button class=\"back-btn\" data-cwl-nav=\"/dashboard\" type=\"button\">\n        ← Dashboard\n      </button>\n      <div class=\"wizards-header-row\">\n        <h1>🧙 List of wizards</h1>\n        <div class=\"wizards-pulldown-wrap\">\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            class=\"wizards-pulldown-trigger\" data-cwl-toggle=\"wizardsPulldownOpen:flip\" data-cwl-on-blur=\"toggle:wizardsPulldownOpen:false\"\n            aria-haspopup=\"true\"\n           aria-label=\"Wizards Pulldown Open\">\n            Jump to wizard ▼\n          </button>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"subtitle\">Guided flows for setup, deployment, and operations. Each wizard runs inside its module. Use <strong>Jump to wizard</strong> above or \"Open in [Module]\" below to go to that module, then click the wizard button in the module header.</p>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"wizards-grid\">\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">🚀</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">First-Time Setup</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Onboarding for new WISP operators: towers, CBRS, ACS, monitoring.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Dashboard / Onboarding</strong> · Shown automatically on first visit, or open from /onboarding.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/onboarding?wizard=first-time-setup\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Dashboard / Onboarding\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open First-Time Setup\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">🏢</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Organization Setup</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Verify or edit organization (tenant) name and contact details.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Onboarding</strong> · Onboarding flow step 1, or open here.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-action=\"open-organization-setup\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open Organization Setup\n\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">⚙️</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Initial Configuration</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Add first tower and configure CBRS, ACS, and Monitoring modules.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Onboarding</strong> · Onboarding flow step 3, or open here.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-action=\"open-initial-configuration\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open Initial Configuration\n\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📍</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Add Site</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Create a new tower, NOC, warehouse, or other site.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Deploy</strong> · Header bar: \"Add Site\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/deploy?wizard=site-deployment\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Deploy\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Add Site\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📦</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Deploy Equipment</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Step-by-step equipment deployment in the field.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Deploy</strong> · Header bar: \"Deploy Equipment\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/deploy?wizard=deploy-equipment\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Deploy\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Deploy Equipment\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📊</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">PCI Planner</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Plan and resolve PCI conflicts across LTE sectors.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Deploy</strong> · Header bar: \"PCI\" button (shows sector count).\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/deploy?wizard=pci-planner\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Deploy\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open PCI Planner\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📡</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Frequency Planner</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Frequency planning for LTE/FWA sectors.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Deploy</strong> · Header bar: \"Frequency\" button (shows sector count).\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/deploy?wizard=frequency-planner\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Deploy\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Frequency Planner\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📡</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">CBRS Setup</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Configure CBRS/SAS and CBSD devices.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>CBRS Management</strong> · Empty state or \"Run Setup Wizard\" / \"Run Setup Wizard →\".\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/cbrs-management?wizard=cbrs-setup\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in CBRS Management\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open CBRS Setup\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📡</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">CBRS Device Registration</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Add a CBSD device (serial, FCC ID, category, location) step-by-step.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>CBRS Management</strong> · Header: \"Register Device Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/cbrs-management?wizard=cbrs-device-registration\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in CBRS Management\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open CBRS Device Registration\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📋</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Work Order Creation</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Create work orders or tickets step-by-step.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Work Orders</strong> · \"Create Work Order Wizard\" button at top.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/work-orders?wizard=work-order-creation\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Work Orders\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Work Order Creation\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">🔐</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Subscriber Creation</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Create HSS/LTE subscriber with IMSI, auth keys, group, and plan.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>HSS & Subscriber Management</strong> · Header: \"Add Subscriber Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/hss-management?wizard=subscriber-creation\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in HSS & Subscriber Management\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Subscriber Creation\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">👋</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Customer Onboarding</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Guided flow to add a new customer (basic info, address, service type, optional LTE).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Customers</strong> · Customers tab: \"Onboarding Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/customers?wizard=customer-onboarding\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Customers\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Customer Onboarding\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📦</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Check-in Wizard</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Check in inventory items (e.g. return equipment).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Inventory</strong> · Header/toolbar: \"Check-in Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/inventory?wizard=inventory-checkin\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Inventory\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Check-in Wizard\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📋</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Track RMA</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Mark an inventory item as RMA and record RMA number, vendor, and reason.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Inventory</strong> · Header/toolbar: \"Track RMA\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/inventory?wizard=rma-tracking\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Inventory\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Track RMA\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📶</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Bandwidth Plan</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Create an HSS bandwidth plan (name, download/upload Mbps).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>HSS & Subscriber Management</strong> · Header: \"Add Plan Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/hss-management?wizard=bandwidth-plan\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in HSS & Subscriber Management\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Bandwidth Plan\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📦</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Subscriber Group</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Create an HSS subscriber group (name, optional plan, APN, QCI).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>HSS & Subscriber Management</strong> · Header: \"Add Group Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/hss-management?wizard=subscriber-group\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in HSS & Subscriber Management\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Subscriber Group\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📊</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Monitoring Setup</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Set up network monitoring (sites, devices, alerts).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Monitor</strong> · Header: wizard icon button, or empty state \"Get Started with Setup Wizard\".\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/monitoring?wizard=monitoring-setup\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Monitor\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Monitoring Setup\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📊</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Conflict Resolution Wizard</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Identify and resolve PCI conflicts step-by-step (analyze, optimize, apply, verify).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>PCI Resolution</strong> · Left sidebar: \"Conflict Wizard\" button.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/pci-resolution?wizard=conflict-resolution\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in PCI Resolution\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Conflict Resolution Wizard\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📥</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Import Wizard</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Import data (e.g. PCI/sector data) from file.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>PCI Resolution</strong> · Header/toolbar: \"Import\" to open Import Wizard.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/pci-resolution?wizard=import-wizard\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in PCI Resolution\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Import Wizard\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">🔧</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">EPC Deployment</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Register and deploy EPC devices.</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Hardware</strong> · Add menu (dropdown) → EPC deployment / wizard option.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/hardware?wizard=epc-deployment\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Hardware\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open EPC Deployment\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"wizard-card\">\n          <div class=\"wizard-icon\">📍</div>\n          <h2 class=\"wizard-name\">Marketing Discovery</h2>\n          <p class=\"wizard-desc\">Add marketing addresses to a plan (coverage discovery).</p>\n          <p class=\"wizard-where\">\n            <strong>Plan</strong> · Inside a plan: use marketing/address discovery for the plan.\n          </p>\n          <button\n            class=\"open-in-module\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/plan?wizard=marketing-discovery\"\n            type=\"button\"\n           aria-label=\"Goto\">\n\n              Open in Plan\n\n              <div hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">Open Marketing Discovery\n            </div>\n          </button>\n        </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div data-cwl-component=\"OrganizationSetupWizard\" data-cwl-lifted-component=\"OrganizationSetupWizard\"><div class=\"cwl-self-gated-shell\" data-cwl-shell-key=\"showOrgWizard\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wizard-overlay\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"org-wizard-title\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"wizard-modal\">\n      <div class=\"wizard-header\">\n        <h2 id=\"org-wizard-title\">🏢 Organization Setup</h2>\n        <button class=\"close-btn\" data-cwl-action=\"handleClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">✕</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wizard-content\">\n        <div class=\"wizard-panel\">\n          <p>Verify your organization details. You can edit these later in Settings.</p>\n          <div data-cwl-bind=\"if\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"$currentTenant\"><div class=\"info-card\">\n              <div class=\"info-row\">\n                <span class=\"label\">Organization Name:</span>\n                <span class=\"value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"$currentTenant.displayName\"></span></span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"info-row\">\n                <span class=\"label\">Contact Email:</span>\n                <span class=\"value\"><span data-cwl-bind=\"interp\" data-cwl-hole-detail=\"$currentTenant.contactEmail ?? '—'\"></span></span>\n              </div>\n            </div></div>\n            <p class=\"hint\">No tenant selected. Select a tenant from the dashboard or complete tenant setup first.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/dashboard?panel=settings\">Edit in Settings</button>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-action=\"handleClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">Done</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div>\n  <div data-cwl-component=\"InitialConfigurationWizard\" data-cwl-lifted-component=\"InitialConfigurationWizard\"><div class=\"cwl-self-gated-shell\" data-cwl-shell-key=\"showConfigWizard\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wizard-overlay\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"config-wizard-title\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"wizard-modal\">\n      <div class=\"wizard-header\">\n        <h2 id=\"config-wizard-title\">⚙️ Initial Configuration</h2>\n        <button class=\"close-btn\" data-cwl-action=\"handleClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">✕</button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"wizard-content\">\n        <div class=\"wizard-panel\">\n          <p>Add your first tower and configure the modules you'll use. You can do these later from the Dashboard.</p>\n\n          <div class=\"section\">\n            <h3>Add First Tower</h3>\n            <p class=\"section-desc\">Add a tower site for coverage planning.</p>\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-primary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/coverage-map\">Open Coverage Map</button>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"section\">\n            <h3>Configure Modules</h3>\n            <div class=\"modules-grid\">\n              <div class=\"module-card\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">📡</span>\n                <h4>CBRS Management</h4>\n                <p>Configure SAS API keys</p>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/cbrs-management\">Setup CBRS</button>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"module-card\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">⚙️</span>\n                <h4>ACS/TR-069</h4>\n                <p>Configure network monitoring</p>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/monitoring\">Setup ACS</button>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"module-card\">\n                <span class=\"icon\">📊</span>\n                <h4>Monitoring</h4>\n                <p>Configure SNMP and monitoring</p>\n                <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-nav=\"/modules/monitoring\">Setup Monitoring</button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"actions\">\n            <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-secondary\" data-cwl-action=\"handleClose\" aria-label=\"Close\">Done</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div></div></div></div>";
}

